title: 'statement-store: metrics for the v2 DHT rollout'
doc:
  - audience: Node Operator
    description: |
      Adds metrics to help watch the statement store while some nodes run the new v2 DHT mode
      and others don't yet.

      These metrics now have a `route` label (`dht` or `flood`). Their names stay the same, so
      dashboards that read them without labels may need a `sum()`:
      - `substrate_sync_statement_bytes_received_total`
      - `substrate_sync_initial_sync_statements_sent`
      - `substrate_sync_initial_sync_bursts_total`
      - `substrate_sync_initial_sync_duration_seconds`

      New metrics:
      - `substrate_sync_statement_peers_assumed_match_all_total`: peers that did not send their
        filter in time.
      - `substrate_sync_statement_late_affinity_filters_total`: peers whose filter arrived late.
      - `substrate_sub_statement_store_bytes_by_retention`: bytes in the store per retention track.
crates:
  - name: sc-network-statement
    bump: patch
  - name: sc-statement-store
    bump: patch
